AGRONOMIC DISCLAIMER / AGRONOMIK OGOHLANTIRISH

This software is a prototype (MVP). It is not a certified laboratory
instrument and does not replace accredited soil analysis. Fertilizer
recommendations produced by this software are pilot values that require
validation through local field trials and confirmation by a qualified
agronomist.

Ushbu dastur prototip (MVP) hisoblanadi. U sertifikatlangan laboratoriya
uskunasi emas va akkreditatsiyalangan tuproq tahlilining o'rnini bosmaydi.
Dastur beradigan o'g'itlash tavsiyalari pilot qiymatlar bo'lib, mahalliy dala
tajribalari orqali validatsiya qilinishi va malakali agronom tomonidan
tasdiqlanishi kerak.
